{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702990/extras/gifDemoFinal.gif?t=1746620233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robot Zizzy lives inside a TV screen, in a neon 2D world. One day he discovers that its inhabitants are missing. We are going to find out that the evil robot Magnus has kidnapped them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offscreen Demo is the beginning of a great journey: you will break out of the TV into 3D world to return the inhabitants, defeat the kidnapper and find out the whole truth. On the way we will meet new friends and many unusual puzzles. You will walk across the neon city through the TVs, move and break them to restore balance in the two worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702990/extras/1gif.gif?t=1746620233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key gameplay feature: You have to move the TVs in the 3D world to make one big level from the screens. You will be able to jump inside the screen and complete the level!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702990?t=1746620233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702990?t=1746620233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702990/7fa1866084cc7ee29d346597d239498feff28abc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746620233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702990/7fa1866084cc7ee29d346597d239498feff28abc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746620233","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","